    accTitle: From your question to an answer
    accDescr: Follow the numbered connectors. Subnumbers identify branches or smaller steps. Optional actions and supporting relationships are labeled separately. The usual journey for a question that needs database data: ask in plain language, prepare a database query, read matching data, and return an answer with a table. Other diagrams explain direct answers, errors, and optional features.

    ASK(["You ask a question in plain language"]):::view
    QUERY["AI prepares SQL (a database query)"]:::work
    READ[("The app safely reads the database")]:::data
    ANSWER["You receive an answer and a result table"]:::view

    ASK -->|1| QUERY
    QUERY -->|2| READ
    READ -->|3| ANSWER

